# Living Worlds layer repository (GitHub)

**20 concepts** in `config/morning_living_worlds.json` · **Docs:** `docs/LIVING-WORLDS-LAYERS-REPO.md` · **Index:** `data/living_worlds/layers/index.json`

## Where files live

| Asset | Path |
|-------|------|
| Scene hero plate | `assets/living_worlds/<slug>/scene-raw.png` |
| Transparent layers | `assets/living_worlds/<slug>/layers/*.png` |
| Manifest + prompts | `data/living_worlds/layers/<style_id>/` |
| Remotion public copy | `remotion/public/layers/<slug>/` |

**Slug:** `living_crystal_morning_machine` → `living-crystal-morning-machine`

## Required before Remotion render

1. `scene-raw.png` — colorful shop-made hero, six anchors, **no readable text**
2. Decomposed **transparent PNGs** per `manifest.json` `required_layers`
3. `background-plate.png` has moving objects **removed** (no duplicate on top)
4. `python3 -m marketing living-world-layers sync` then `cd remotion && npm run validate:layers`

## CLI (use these — do not invent paths)

```bash
python3 -m marketing living-world-layers init --all
python3 -m marketing living-world-layers status
python3 -m marketing living-world-layers register-scene <style_id> <png>
python3 -m marketing living-world-layers sync
python3 -m marketing living-world-layers validate
```

Layer prompts: `data/living_worlds/layers/<style_id>/prompts/layer-*.txt`

## Founder approval (not autopilot)

- `manifest.json` → `approval.founder_look`: pending until Founder says yes/no
- `approval.assigned_date`: null until Founder picks calendar day
- **Crystal Morning Machine** = `pilot_hold` — do not publish

## Six anchors

Crystal · jewelry · incense · candle · reader · coffee — every scene and decomposition.

## Text

Live React in `EventPanel` — never bake schedule/reader/date/phone/site into PNGs.

## Do not

- Ship flat PIL/ffmpeg animation (`render_preview_loop`) for production
- Skip layer decomposition and zoom/pan scene-raw
- Reuse URLs (`image_usage`)
- Generic mystic AI template art
- Put dollar prices on graphics

## Color + brand

Bright jewel tones, eggplant Sacred Ground accents, shop-made energy — see `social-image-branding.mdc` and `morning-living-worlds.mdc`.
